# Mental Health Support Chatbot

A Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot that provides **grounded, responsible** information on mental health, stress, sleep, and wellbeing using trusted sources.

**Live Demo**: [Hugging Face Space](https://huggingface.co/spaces/ggebreselassie29144/mental-health-chatbot)

## Features
- Conversational interface built with Gradio
- RAG architecture (semantic search over WHO/CBT documents)
- Multiple LLM support with smart fallback
- Strong safety disclaimers (not medical advice)

## How to Run Locally (No API Key Required)

### 1. Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Dr0m0x/MSAI631-mental-health-rag-chatbot.git
cd MSAI631-mental-health-rag-chatbot
